<title>GREECE: IONIAN BANK LAUNCHES TWO NEW BRANCHES.</title>
<headline>IONIAN BANK LAUNCHES TWO NEW BRANCHES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Ionian Bank said on Friday its two new branches in Kamatero and Mesogion avenue which bring its total branch network to 222 will be open for business on Monday, February 24. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
